WEBVTT

00:11.011 --> 00:13.556
[rock music playing]

00:43.043 --> 00:47.965
CHAPTER 19:
YOU JUST HAVE SUCH GOOD CHEMISTRY

00:50.092 --> 00:51.844
EPISODE 6

00:52.428 --> 00:55.514
[Eui-ju sighs]
This can't actually be happening.

00:55.598 --> 00:59.101
This has to be a dream or something.
Something this crazy can't be real.

00:59.185 --> 01:00.811
It just can't be.

01:00.895 --> 01:02.146
[breathes shakily]

01:02.229 --> 01:03.230
[Eui-ju whimpers]

01:04.565 --> 01:06.525
Oh, I better just go kill myself.

01:06.609 --> 01:07.860
That might do.

01:07.943 --> 01:10.654
Of all people,
I have to get caught by Math.

01:10.738 --> 01:13.073
[sighs] This is so, so embarrassing.

01:13.157 --> 01:14.742
So embarrassing.

01:15.576 --> 01:18.954
What the heck?
What's taking him so long to read it?

01:19.038 --> 01:21.707
[gasps] Is he enjoying it?

01:23.209 --> 01:24.210
What?

01:24.752 --> 01:25.753
Huh?

01:26.545 --> 01:27.546
What?

01:37.264 --> 01:40.434
[Eui-ju]
Is this how a genius tortures someone?

01:40.518 --> 01:43.145
Killing me with shame
without leaving a mark on me?

01:48.025 --> 01:50.069
[gulps, inhales sharply]

01:52.154 --> 01:54.031
-Yeo Eui-ju.
-Yes?

01:55.241 --> 01:56.450
What is this?

01:56.534 --> 01:57.535
Huh?

02:01.789 --> 02:03.040
I asked you what this is.

02:04.625 --> 02:05.751
Oh…

02:06.460 --> 02:07.920
[smacks lips, stammers]

02:08.671 --> 02:10.422
Well… [stammers]

02:10.506 --> 02:13.884
Someone must have been
writing a web novel on that.

02:15.344 --> 02:16.887
-Really?
-[chuckles]

02:17.847 --> 02:19.431
Oh…

02:19.515 --> 02:22.351
Holy cow, I was just as shocked. It's…

02:22.434 --> 02:24.103
It's outrageous, right?

02:25.145 --> 02:26.981
-You didn't write it?
-No.

02:27.690 --> 02:28.941
[stammers] No, I didn't write it.

02:29.024 --> 02:31.485
So you're saying you drank
but you weren't drinking?

02:32.111 --> 02:35.155
I caught red-handed,
and you're still trying to deny it.

02:38.576 --> 02:41.203
This goofy guy who majors in Korean
is Yoon Dong-ju.

02:41.287 --> 02:43.080
And the arrogant prick…

02:46.709 --> 02:48.210
and math genius is me.

02:49.253 --> 02:50.337
The simple-headed jock

02:50.421 --> 02:53.424
who tries to muscle his way
through everything is Jung Gi-jeon.

02:53.507 --> 02:56.927
And the Japanese teacher
who's got nothing but money

02:57.011 --> 02:58.012
is No Da-ju.

02:59.513 --> 03:01.974
[chuckles]

03:02.057 --> 03:04.268
Come on, Mr. Ga. That's crazy.

03:06.312 --> 03:08.105
"I didn't realize
you were such a lost cause."

03:08.188 --> 03:09.565
"I'm very disappointed."

03:09.648 --> 03:12.484
"It was clear who's in the wrong here
and you admitted to it as well."

03:12.568 --> 03:14.904
"So I guess,
I just need to be compensated."

03:14.987 --> 03:16.906
"And it has to be something
other than money."

03:18.824 --> 03:21.702
You wrote down what I said word for word
just by chance?

03:24.538 --> 03:27.291
"This is because
you didn't let him sleep last night."

03:27.374 --> 03:29.585
"Don't you know that he's a sleepyhead."

03:29.668 --> 03:31.337
You heard that in the car.

03:31.420 --> 03:33.464
Is it just a coincidence,
or am I making it up?

03:34.715 --> 03:36.508
You have such good chemistry.

03:38.761 --> 03:39.803
What?

03:39.887 --> 03:43.057
The chemistry among you is so good
that I tried writing a story about you.

03:43.140 --> 03:44.141
[stammers]

03:44.224 --> 03:46.685
And people loved it there, so I just…

03:48.103 --> 03:49.229
[sighs]

03:50.022 --> 03:52.483
You shouldn't ever cross that line.

03:52.566 --> 03:54.401
There are things you can do
and things you can't.

03:54.485 --> 03:56.612
[breathes shakily] I'm very sorry.

03:57.363 --> 03:58.530
Delete it.

04:00.115 --> 04:01.116
Huh?

04:02.409 --> 04:03.410
No.

04:04.203 --> 04:06.705
-Excuse me?
-[breathes shakily]

04:06.789 --> 04:08.582
Uh, no, I-I can't do that.

04:08.666 --> 04:11.418
Please, Mr. Ga. Please show me mercy.
Just this once.

04:11.502 --> 04:13.921
I-I can't delete it.
I'm sorry. I truly am.

04:14.004 --> 04:15.214
But I still can't delete it.

04:15.297 --> 04:18.759
How do you expect me to show mercy
on as student who writes an outrageous

04:18.842 --> 04:20.678
and unspeakable story about her teachers?

04:20.761 --> 04:21.971
Is it worth letting it slide?

04:22.054 --> 04:23.430
Just put yourself in my shoes.

04:23.514 --> 04:25.724
[breathes shakily] Still.

04:26.809 --> 04:28.060
Still, I can't delete it.

04:28.727 --> 04:29.853
I just can't.

04:31.397 --> 04:32.398
Really?

04:33.732 --> 04:36.110
-I'll do it then.
-[Eui-ju gasps]

04:39.530 --> 04:40.823
PASSWORD

04:41.573 --> 04:42.783
[sighs]

04:45.327 --> 04:46.537
Unlock it.

04:48.122 --> 04:49.540
Mr. Ga.

04:49.623 --> 04:53.502
Mr. Ga, I promise
I'll study really, really hard.

04:53.585 --> 04:55.838
I'll really study math too. Please!

04:55.921 --> 04:57.631
Please, let it slide this once.

04:57.715 --> 04:59.341
Even the dead get their wishes granted.

04:59.425 --> 05:01.760
Can't you think of it
as saving a miserable student?

05:01.844 --> 05:04.096
[gasps] This means the world to me.

05:04.179 --> 05:06.306
I can't possibly delete this novel.

05:06.390 --> 05:09.018
[crying] Please show mercy, Mr. Ga.

05:09.101 --> 05:10.227
[crying]

05:10.310 --> 05:13.647
I'll do everything,
but don't delete it. [crying]

05:13.731 --> 05:17.943
How could I? I just can't. I can't do it.

05:18.027 --> 05:20.821
Please, just this once. [crying]

05:20.904 --> 05:22.948
What do I do?

05:23.032 --> 05:26.827
[crying] I'm sorry.

05:26.910 --> 05:29.121
[crying continues]

05:35.210 --> 05:37.087
30 MINUTES LATER

05:37.171 --> 05:39.798
[crying continues]

05:46.805 --> 05:49.058
[inhales, exhales heavily]

05:49.683 --> 05:50.893
[cries]

05:51.769 --> 05:54.855
-If you can't delete, then…
-[sighs, sniffles]

05:56.565 --> 05:57.900
…tell your parents to come.

05:59.401 --> 06:01.153
-What?
-If you want to let your parents,

06:01.236 --> 06:03.280
the principal, the teachers,
and the entire school

06:03.363 --> 06:04.740
know what you've been writing online.

06:05.532 --> 06:08.494
No, I can't.
My mom will kill me if she finds out.

06:09.495 --> 06:11.538
So that means you're not proud
of what you've done either.

06:11.622 --> 06:12.831
[breathes shakily]

06:14.083 --> 06:17.127
Why do you want to continue
if you can't even share it with others?

06:19.505 --> 06:21.215
Delete it or bring your parents to school.

06:21.298 --> 06:22.382
I'll check by tomorrow.

06:24.843 --> 06:26.053
No.

06:26.637 --> 06:27.930
[whimpers]

06:33.102 --> 06:34.103
[whimpers]

06:34.895 --> 06:36.480
[crying]

06:41.735 --> 06:46.240
CHAPTER 20: THE OBSESSIVE TOP DOESN'T EVEN
HAVE A TOILET IN HIS BATHROOM

06:46.323 --> 06:47.991
[keypad beeping]

06:48.075 --> 06:49.284
[door unlocks]

06:51.703 --> 06:53.163
[door slams]

06:54.581 --> 06:55.666
[alarm beeps]

06:57.751 --> 06:59.294
[Dad] Mmm, it's good.

06:59.378 --> 07:00.587
Hello, I'm home.

07:00.671 --> 07:02.297
[Mom, Dad chewing] Mmm!

07:02.381 --> 07:03.757
I made galbijjim.

07:03.841 --> 07:05.259
Uh…

07:05.342 --> 07:06.885
I'm not hungry.

07:08.220 --> 07:10.472
Huh? What's wrong? Are you sick?

07:11.598 --> 07:12.599
No.

07:14.226 --> 07:16.645
But… Should I make you some tteokbokki?

07:16.728 --> 07:18.188
[Eui-ju] No, thanks.

07:21.942 --> 07:22.985
[grunts]

07:23.068 --> 07:25.279
[sighs]

07:26.155 --> 07:27.364
Should I delete it?

07:28.407 --> 07:29.908
[breathes sharply]

07:29.992 --> 07:32.536
I can't do that. [sighs]

07:32.619 --> 07:34.913
Everyone will find out about my novel.

07:34.997 --> 07:38.500
Well, wouldn't that be better
than deleting it though?

07:39.334 --> 07:42.212
No, that's insane.
It's better if I just delete it.

07:44.006 --> 07:45.507
[breathes heavily]

07:47.551 --> 07:48.927
[cries]

07:50.095 --> 07:51.722
[both laughing]

07:51.805 --> 07:54.016
-[person on TV talking indistinctly]
-[door closes]

07:55.058 --> 07:56.768
-You're back.
-[Woo-su] Yeah.

07:58.395 --> 08:00.647
-[Gi-jeon] Hi.
-[Dong-ju] Hi.

08:00.731 --> 08:02.024
[Dong-ju laughs]

08:02.941 --> 08:05.485
[electronic music plays]

08:08.989 --> 08:13.577
[Eui-ju] Tae-ha gently touches
Yoon's milky bare skin…

08:13.660 --> 08:15.287
[dreamy music plays]

08:15.370 --> 08:16.747
…underneath the clothes.

08:17.956 --> 08:19.333
[chuckles]

08:20.584 --> 08:22.628
You two, get off each other!

08:23.503 --> 08:24.755
Get off each other!

08:25.464 --> 08:27.174
-[stammers] What's wrong?
-Holy cow.

08:28.467 --> 08:29.927
-[Gi-jeon] You want a round?
-[Dong-ju] Nah, we shouldn't.

08:30.010 --> 08:31.178
[Gi-jeon] Come on. Just one round.

08:31.261 --> 08:33.180
-Let's play just one round.
-We should go to bed.

08:33.263 --> 08:36.225
You want to, right? I know you want to.
Just one round.

08:36.808 --> 08:38.101
[whispers] Just one.

08:38.185 --> 08:40.604
-[Eui-ju] Let's do it once.
-What do you say?

08:40.687 --> 08:41.772
[Eui-ju] Just once.

08:49.655 --> 08:50.781
Hey! Me too! Me too!

08:50.864 --> 08:53.242
-[Da-ju] Make some space. Move.
-[Gi-jeon] Oh, the three of us together?

08:53.325 --> 08:54.993
You worked your legs today? Nice.

08:55.077 --> 08:56.828
[huffs] Stop it.

08:57.913 --> 08:59.456
Not two, not three. No way!

09:00.123 --> 09:01.375
Alone.

09:03.043 --> 09:05.128
-[whispers] Damn it!
-[Da-ju] Do what alone?

09:05.212 --> 09:07.172
[stuttering] What's wrong with you?

09:08.298 --> 09:10.509
Wanna play too? I could change partners.

09:10.592 --> 09:11.969
I lost it.

09:13.011 --> 09:15.889
My sanity's all gone. [sighs]

09:15.973 --> 09:17.808
What on earth was all that?

09:19.851 --> 09:21.061
[sighs]

09:28.610 --> 09:29.695
BOYS' LOVE

09:29.778 --> 09:31.321
[Young-hee]
Attention students and faculty.

09:31.405 --> 09:33.365
We have an important announcement to make.

09:33.448 --> 09:36.368
It has been confirmed
that Eui-ju from Class 2

09:36.451 --> 09:39.371
has written a BL novel
titled We Were Friends.

09:39.454 --> 09:42.332
We ask for your full attention
regarding this matter.

09:42.416 --> 09:46.670
BL? Didn't you say BL was boring?
Was that just a big lie or something?

09:46.753 --> 09:47.838
Go-ya!

09:47.921 --> 09:49.047
You're just creepy, huh?

09:49.131 --> 09:52.009
Is this what you've been doing
behind the whole sweet act?

09:52.092 --> 09:53.593
Why pair two boys together?

09:53.677 --> 09:55.429
-[sighs] You're wrong.
-[Mom] Eui-ju.

09:58.515 --> 09:59.516
Mom.

10:00.642 --> 10:01.810
Mom, what's wrong?

10:01.893 --> 10:03.228
Mom, I…

10:03.312 --> 10:05.188
[screams, grunts]

10:07.399 --> 10:09.776
You! You realize this is a crime.

10:09.860 --> 10:12.321
You've tarnished my reputation
and character.

10:12.404 --> 10:14.197
Go rot in prison for the rest of you life!

10:14.281 --> 10:15.574
No, I'm so sorry.

10:16.283 --> 10:17.409
[Gi-jeon] Are you crazy?

10:18.035 --> 10:20.078
Of all things, you did that?

10:20.162 --> 10:21.204
You're disgusting, Eui-ju.

10:21.288 --> 10:22.831
Disgusting.

10:23.832 --> 10:25.375
Oh, no.

10:25.459 --> 10:26.668
You're wrong, Mr. Yoon.

10:26.752 --> 10:28.712
-All I wanted was… [sighs]
-[scoffs]

10:30.797 --> 10:33.050
[whimpers]

10:33.133 --> 10:34.259
[Dad] Apologies!

10:34.343 --> 10:35.594
Let me apologize!

10:35.677 --> 10:38.430
Please! My daughter's innocent!
It's all on me! [whimpers]

10:38.513 --> 10:39.973
It's because of my influence on her.

10:40.057 --> 10:42.267
I'm actually the one
who started it in our family.

10:42.351 --> 10:44.144
-No, Dad. [sniffles]
-[Dad] I'm to blame.

10:44.227 --> 10:46.229
[footsteps approaching]

10:49.399 --> 10:50.609
[gasps]

10:50.692 --> 10:53.570
[whimpering] No. No!

10:53.653 --> 10:55.822
Huh? What are you doing?
What are you doing?

10:55.906 --> 10:58.283
[screams] What are you doing?
Let go of me!

10:58.367 --> 11:00.869
[scraping]

11:00.952 --> 11:03.288
What the? Don't come close. Don't…

11:05.916 --> 11:07.918
-[shouts]
-[screams]

11:08.001 --> 11:09.544
[gasps]

11:09.628 --> 11:10.837
[exhales heavily]

11:11.755 --> 11:13.924
Oh, no. [breathing shakily]

11:14.007 --> 11:15.092
Oh, no.

11:15.175 --> 11:17.219
No one can find out about this.

11:18.095 --> 11:20.472
So that means you're not proud
of what you've done either.

11:21.056 --> 11:23.809
Why do you want to continue
if you can't even share it with others?

11:23.892 --> 11:25.268
[sighs]

11:25.352 --> 11:27.646
[whimpering]

11:27.729 --> 11:29.064
[sighs]

11:29.147 --> 11:30.565
Let's see here.

11:31.066 --> 11:34.986
"The character with the biggest fan base
is an obsessive guy."

11:35.779 --> 11:40.075
"He lives in a marble penthouse
where he always keeps the lights off."

11:40.158 --> 11:41.284
[whimpers]

11:41.368 --> 11:44.830
[Woo-su] "He is estranged from his family
and has no friends."

11:45.580 --> 11:48.667
"When he showers, he only uses
a rainfall showerhead."

11:48.750 --> 11:50.669
"And in his bathroom, there's…"

11:51.920 --> 11:52.921
NO TOILET

11:53.505 --> 11:54.506
"…no toilet?"

11:57.134 --> 11:58.135
Why?

11:58.927 --> 12:00.220
[gasps]

12:00.303 --> 12:01.388
[sighs]

12:02.222 --> 12:03.390
Why Math?

12:03.974 --> 12:06.059
Why did I have to get caught by that jerk?

12:07.394 --> 12:09.855
[electronic music playing]

12:11.898 --> 12:16.570
[shouting] Ga Woo-su!

12:17.195 --> 12:18.655
[groans]

12:24.327 --> 12:25.871
[student] Hello. Good morning.

12:34.212 --> 12:35.464
[Woo-su] Follow me.

12:41.720 --> 12:44.639
COUNSELING IN PROGRESS

12:44.723 --> 12:45.849
Is it gone?

12:51.771 --> 12:53.356
Mr. Ga. [sighs]

12:53.440 --> 12:57.444
I have been writing web novels
since I was in eighth grade.

13:00.071 --> 13:01.156
And?

13:01.865 --> 13:06.036
It all started as just a messy mash up
of the stories I liked.

13:06.119 --> 13:09.623
But then later on, I posted the
first episode to the Challenge League

13:09.706 --> 13:11.958
just so I could give it a try, and then…

13:12.042 --> 13:13.793
Suddenly, the number of favorites hit two.

13:13.877 --> 13:16.463
It got me so excited
that I did a mass release

13:16.546 --> 13:18.215
of two more episodes.

13:19.049 --> 13:20.050
Uh…

13:20.550 --> 13:23.720
Mass release. What that means
is when you begin a new piece

13:23.803 --> 13:26.181
and need to bulk upload several episodes

13:26.264 --> 13:28.558
in order to bring some responses.

13:28.642 --> 13:29.726
You know?

13:29.809 --> 13:32.145
Anyway, the number of favorites
went back to one,

13:32.229 --> 13:33.688
which meant only one thing.

13:33.772 --> 13:35.607
Someone read the other two episodes

13:36.441 --> 13:37.442
and ghosted.

13:37.526 --> 13:39.402
10 MINUTES LATER

13:39.486 --> 13:40.487
[sighs]

13:40.570 --> 13:44.366
So now when I wake up in the morning,
there's only one thought in my head.

13:44.449 --> 13:45.700
Ah…

13:46.243 --> 13:48.370
I finally made it out of the tunnel.

13:48.453 --> 13:50.580
What I thought
was a hopeless dead-end cave

13:50.664 --> 13:52.499
was actually a tunnel.

13:52.582 --> 13:55.669
I've survived that freezing, lonely winter
and now…

13:57.045 --> 14:00.465
I feel like I'm finally starting to bloom
into who I'm meant to be.

14:01.716 --> 14:02.801
Mr. Ga,

14:03.301 --> 14:06.930
this novel is a ray of hope and a dream.

14:07.013 --> 14:08.848
Too precious to let go of for me.

14:08.932 --> 14:11.643
Could you please
just let your student achieve her dream?

14:11.726 --> 14:13.979
Could you please let me finish this novel?

14:15.021 --> 14:16.022
I can't.

14:16.940 --> 14:17.941
Just this once.

14:18.024 --> 14:19.526
Please, just this once.

14:20.902 --> 14:22.862
You're really gonna keep writing
that kind of stuff

14:22.946 --> 14:24.114
you shouldn't even say out loud?

14:24.197 --> 14:26.992
It's so disgusting,
I get chills just thinking about it.

14:31.538 --> 14:33.665
-You don't deserve to cry.
-I know.

14:34.833 --> 14:37.252
I know that what I've done is wrong.

14:38.253 --> 14:40.380
But I can't possibly bring myself
to delete it.

14:40.463 --> 14:43.758
-It's got more than 20,000 fans.
-[sighs]

14:43.842 --> 14:46.761
Some might think I'm the villain here,
but I'm actually the victim, get it?

14:47.387 --> 14:49.222
Of all the genres out there!

14:50.682 --> 14:52.434
Why does it have to be BL?

14:53.226 --> 14:57.647
When it's all "we can't, we can't,"
it just makes you root for them even more.

14:57.731 --> 15:01.276
Even just their fingertips touching
feels so intense.

15:03.486 --> 15:05.196
Are you even aware of what you did wrong?

15:05.280 --> 15:06.865
[sighs] I am.

15:07.824 --> 15:09.618
I am. [sniffles]

15:09.701 --> 15:12.912
But if you really think about it,
it's all the same kind of love.

15:12.996 --> 15:15.624
It's just people loving people.
The gender shouldn't matter.

15:15.707 --> 15:17.000
Not that.

15:18.460 --> 15:20.462
It isn't?

15:20.545 --> 15:21.963
You mean the physical stuff?

15:22.047 --> 15:24.132
But, Mr. Ga, it's not even PG-15.

15:24.215 --> 15:26.051
The publishing company
called it "pretty soft" too.

15:26.134 --> 15:27.302
Really soft.

15:28.970 --> 15:30.805
It's not that? Oh…

15:32.265 --> 15:35.685
Yes, you're right. I used the teachers
as the main characters in the novel.

15:35.769 --> 15:37.020
That's inexcusable.

15:37.103 --> 15:38.688
I'm truly sorry, but--

15:38.772 --> 15:40.565
You know, you really are a lost cause.

15:43.276 --> 15:44.944
You still don't know what you did wrong?

15:45.028 --> 15:47.030
Just… [scoffs]
How can you not be aware of it?

15:47.113 --> 15:49.157
-I'm sorry.
-I just don't get it.

15:49.240 --> 15:50.784
[sighs]

15:50.867 --> 15:52.118
How is it,

15:52.952 --> 15:54.120
and just why…

15:56.289 --> 15:57.916
am I not the protagonist?

15:58.458 --> 15:59.918
[owl hoots]

16:00.001 --> 16:01.211
[quizzical music plays]

16:01.294 --> 16:02.295
What?

16:03.588 --> 16:06.216
Yoon Dong-ju and Jung Gi-jeon
will end up together in the novel,

16:06.299 --> 16:07.550
so, what's my role?

16:08.468 --> 16:09.511
[stammers]

16:09.594 --> 16:11.096
You're a side character.

16:12.430 --> 16:13.431
Side?

16:14.557 --> 16:15.684
[scoffs]

16:15.767 --> 16:17.977
I've never been side anything
in my entire life.

16:19.854 --> 16:20.855
Huh?

16:21.356 --> 16:22.857
If you can't delete it, change it.

16:22.941 --> 16:24.109
The protagonist

16:25.193 --> 16:26.194
is me.

16:28.571 --> 16:30.407
-Huh?
-You know, the main character.

16:32.075 --> 16:34.035
You wanna be the obsessive guy,
is that it?

16:35.912 --> 16:37.539
If that's the protagonist.

16:38.039 --> 16:39.040
Wait…

16:39.833 --> 16:42.669
Uh… Hmm… Hold on, I can't do that.
The story will get off track.

16:42.752 --> 16:44.504
Whichever direction it goes,

16:44.587 --> 16:46.715
I'll check before you post each episode,
that's all.

16:46.798 --> 16:47.924
Oh!

16:48.675 --> 16:50.176
You can't do that, Mr. Ga.

16:50.260 --> 16:51.761
You can't check my writing. No way!

16:53.471 --> 16:54.681
Why?

16:54.764 --> 16:55.807
Well…

16:57.225 --> 16:58.518
I mean… [sighs]

16:58.601 --> 17:01.980
How am I supposed to write that novel
knowing you'll read it.

17:02.063 --> 17:03.189
Then delete it.

17:05.150 --> 17:06.151
[cries]

17:06.234 --> 17:07.235
[phone buzzes]

17:12.615 --> 17:14.075
You only have two choices.

17:14.159 --> 17:16.077
Delete it or keep writing it
under my supervision.

17:16.161 --> 17:17.495
Which one will it be?

17:18.496 --> 17:21.166
[whines]

17:22.125 --> 17:24.961
[whines] Fine,
I'll write it under your supervision.

17:27.130 --> 17:28.131
[whimpers]

17:30.216 --> 17:32.010
How am I supposed to do that?

17:42.896 --> 17:44.814
[groans]

17:44.898 --> 17:48.318
He's mad just because
he's not the protagonist

17:48.401 --> 17:49.903
and not because of the genre?

17:52.155 --> 17:54.157
[groans] He's out of his mind.

17:54.783 --> 17:57.243
He's completely out of his mind,
that's for sure.

17:57.327 --> 17:59.078
EBC FILMING PROPOSAL

17:59.162 --> 18:00.830
CHAPTER 21:
YOU REALLY THINK WOO-SU WILL DO IT?

18:02.916 --> 18:04.292
3. OBJECTIVE

18:05.001 --> 18:06.002
[knocks on door]

18:06.085 --> 18:07.295
[Young-hee] Come in.

18:08.630 --> 18:10.882
Oh, welcome, welcome. Please come in.

18:10.965 --> 18:12.342
Have a seat.

18:15.512 --> 18:16.513
Take a look.

18:19.599 --> 18:22.602
So EBC is coming to film our school?

18:22.685 --> 18:24.020
Finally.

18:24.103 --> 18:28.399
We are very excited to announce
the popular show will be filming

18:28.483 --> 18:31.277
-at our school this Monday.
-[laughing]

18:33.404 --> 18:36.699
As you know, the teachers here
are the pride of this school.

18:36.783 --> 18:40.787
Once the world sees our top-tier teachers
with their mind-blowing credentials

18:40.870 --> 18:44.582
teach students
with passion and devotion on TV,

18:44.666 --> 18:46.334
our funding will increase.

18:46.417 --> 18:48.336
Right, Mr. Dong-ju?

18:48.419 --> 18:50.129
Huh? M-Me?

18:50.213 --> 18:52.340
Please prepare a touching essay

18:52.423 --> 18:57.512
that contains your educational philosophy
and make sure it's really moving.

18:57.595 --> 18:59.305
[chuckles] Sure.

18:59.389 --> 19:01.057
I can do that. [chuckles]

19:01.140 --> 19:02.517
Mr. Gi-jeon,

19:02.600 --> 19:05.353
please prepare a speech
about how you gave up on your dream

19:05.436 --> 19:07.355
to be an athlete and became a teacher.

19:07.438 --> 19:09.440
Ma'am! [clears throat] Understood.

19:09.524 --> 19:12.485
-And Mr. Da-ju.
-Yes.

19:12.569 --> 19:14.404
If you just walk us through your TUD talk,

19:14.487 --> 19:16.865
it'd be a wonderful experience
for everyone.

19:16.948 --> 19:20.952
"The Principal's Grand Vision"
will be remembered for years to come.

19:21.035 --> 19:24.455
-For years to come. [laughs]
-For years to come. [laughs]

19:24.539 --> 19:27.417
Lastly, my dear Mr. Woo-su.

19:27.500 --> 19:29.669
What's there to even say?

19:29.752 --> 19:32.171
Your existence itself
screams "global elite".

19:32.255 --> 19:36.217
But first,
let's do something about those glasses.

19:36.843 --> 19:38.261
And during class--

19:38.344 --> 19:39.345
I won't do it, Ma'am.

19:41.723 --> 19:42.932
Huh?

19:45.184 --> 19:46.728
I won't participate in the filming.

19:46.811 --> 19:49.397
But I'll cooperate in another way
if there's any.

19:50.732 --> 19:51.774
Mr. Woo-su…

19:52.984 --> 19:54.736
He must've missed it.

19:54.819 --> 19:55.987
[all laughing]

19:56.070 --> 19:57.113
He did.

19:57.196 --> 19:58.823
[laughing]

19:58.907 --> 20:00.950
This is an EBC TV show.

20:01.534 --> 20:04.746
If you say you won't participate,

20:04.829 --> 20:06.497
then what are we going to do?

20:06.581 --> 20:09.584
-[laughs]
-I'm really sorry, but I just can't do it.

20:12.253 --> 20:14.422
Okay, I'm sure you're willing
to reconsider it

20:14.505 --> 20:16.382
for the growth of our school.

20:16.466 --> 20:20.553
Now that I've made my stance, excuse me
if you have nothing more to say, please.

20:22.722 --> 20:24.182
[Young-hee stammers]

20:26.434 --> 20:28.603
[laughs] Don't worry, Ms. Kim.

20:29.354 --> 20:30.813
I'll talk him into doing it.

20:31.397 --> 20:32.899
Mr. Da-ju.

20:32.982 --> 20:34.400
Yes.

20:34.484 --> 20:36.819
-I will be counting on you.
-[chuckles]

20:36.903 --> 20:40.198
I will be expecting all four of you,
including Mr. Ga,

20:40.281 --> 20:42.450
-to participate in this show. [chuckles]
-[chuckles]

20:42.533 --> 20:45.536
We have a week left,
and you can be prepared by then, right?

20:45.620 --> 20:46.746
[Da-ju chuckles]

20:46.829 --> 20:48.206
-Yes. Of course.
-[Da-ju] Yes.

20:48.790 --> 20:49.832
Please don't worry.

20:49.916 --> 20:52.126
-[laughing]
-[Young-hee laughing]

20:53.586 --> 20:55.755
[sighs]

20:55.838 --> 20:57.173
What are you gonna do?

20:58.091 --> 20:59.258
What's your plan?

21:00.343 --> 21:01.344
As if.

21:02.512 --> 21:04.138
Why don't we just do it without him?

21:04.222 --> 21:06.307
You heard the principal.

21:07.767 --> 21:10.144
-It's meaningless without Ga Woo-su.
-[sighs]

21:10.228 --> 21:13.314
We're literally just like Ga Woo-su
and his boys.

21:13.898 --> 21:16.150
So what? You think he'll do it?

21:16.234 --> 21:18.403
You of all people should know that.

21:18.486 --> 21:20.321
So why jump in and say you'd do it?

21:20.405 --> 21:22.156
At this school,

21:22.240 --> 21:23.449
if nothing else,

21:23.533 --> 21:26.995
getting on the principals bad side
is basically a capital offense.

21:28.371 --> 21:29.706
If he doesn't film,

21:30.873 --> 21:32.208
we're all fired.

21:33.751 --> 21:35.003
Come on, that's…

21:36.713 --> 21:37.755
Fired? Really?

21:43.845 --> 21:46.097
Hi, Woo-su. Hey.

21:46.180 --> 21:48.766
-I won't.
-Oh, please. Come on.

21:48.850 --> 21:50.435
Just suck it up and do it.

21:52.729 --> 21:54.022
How can you say that?

21:54.105 --> 21:55.398
Are you serious?

21:55.481 --> 21:56.983
I wish I didn't have to push you.

21:57.066 --> 21:59.569
We have known each other
since third grade.

21:59.652 --> 22:01.612
I know about what happened
more than anyone else.

22:01.696 --> 22:03.239
If you do, then don't push me.

22:03.322 --> 22:04.323
Get out.

22:04.824 --> 22:07.994
Oh, Woo-su,
will you do it if I beg you to?

22:08.077 --> 22:09.746
Don't. Get out.

22:11.831 --> 22:12.832
Fine.

22:15.293 --> 22:16.419
[sighs]

22:27.221 --> 22:28.222
WE WERE FRIENDS

22:29.223 --> 22:30.391
[intriguing music plays]

22:34.645 --> 22:37.315
WE WERE FRIENDS, EPISODE 3

22:38.274 --> 22:40.359
When's she posting the fourth episode?

22:42.779 --> 22:46.282
CHAPTER 22: DO I REALLY HAVE TO CHANGE
THIS FOR YOU TO FEEL VALIDATED?

22:46.365 --> 22:49.786
How am I supposed to write
those lovey-dovey scenes

22:49.869 --> 22:51.162
with him breathing down my neck?

22:52.121 --> 22:53.456
[sighs]

22:54.707 --> 22:57.001
[reader 1] I'm holding my breath
until the fourth episode!

22:57.085 --> 22:59.128
[reader 2] Am I the only one
who senses the tension between these two?

22:59.212 --> 23:00.630
[reader 3] I need the fourth episode now!

23:00.713 --> 23:02.799
[reader 4] When in the world
will we have the fourth episode?

23:07.261 --> 23:08.262
[clears throat]

23:15.228 --> 23:16.521
[sighs, grunts]

23:16.604 --> 23:17.814
Goodness.

23:17.897 --> 23:19.273
[whimpers]

23:24.153 --> 23:25.154
[sighs]

23:26.322 --> 23:28.282
-[Woo-su] Where's the episode?
-[groans]

23:28.866 --> 23:31.494
What happened to "mass release"?
Did you give up?

23:32.954 --> 23:33.955
I'm very sorry.

23:34.038 --> 23:35.665
You don't need to apologize.

23:37.083 --> 23:38.835
Look deeper into Si-on's heart.

23:38.918 --> 23:42.505
Think about what he likes, how he grew up,
and how he feels about his friend, Yoon.

23:42.588 --> 23:44.841
Just focus more on him, okay?

23:56.644 --> 23:58.146
[whimpers]

23:58.229 --> 24:00.189
-EBC is coming to school.
-[gasps]

24:00.273 --> 24:03.109
[groans] I don't want Dong-ju
to become famous.

24:06.154 --> 24:07.530
[Go-ya] Where are you going?

24:26.424 --> 24:27.758
[huffs]

24:32.430 --> 24:33.431
MATHEMATICS

24:41.022 --> 24:44.066
Why do you get anxious and run away
whenever you see Math?

24:45.026 --> 24:46.444
I do?

24:46.527 --> 24:47.528
Why?

24:48.029 --> 24:49.113
I don't.

24:54.660 --> 24:55.661
Where were we?

24:55.745 --> 24:58.122
-We can start from page 101.
-Page 101.

24:58.915 --> 25:00.625
All right, look at question number two.

25:06.172 --> 25:08.299
[sighs] He's so hard-core.

25:08.382 --> 25:11.093
I can't believe he's chewing her out
over her grade.

25:11.177 --> 25:14.305
Lot's of people drop math,
but she's the only one who took the bait.

25:14.889 --> 25:18.643
[sighs] Between after-school and all that,
she seems pretty stressed.

25:19.810 --> 25:21.437
-[gasps]
-Uh, no.

25:22.355 --> 25:23.856
[Dan-ji sighs]

25:26.734 --> 25:29.904
WE WERE FRIENDS, EPISODE 4

25:31.197 --> 25:35.034
THE DOOR TO THE PENTHOUSE OPENS
TO REVEAL A LONG CORRIDOR

25:37.453 --> 25:41.832
HIS HAND CLUTCHING THE STRAP ON HIS BAG,
YOON APPROACHES TAE-HA

25:41.916 --> 25:44.168
I told you not to be late at all.

25:45.211 --> 25:46.337
I'm sorry.

25:46.420 --> 25:47.755
I ran here so I wouldn't be late.

25:47.838 --> 25:49.257
Were you with Ju Si-on?

25:50.341 --> 25:52.927
YOON COULDN'T
BRING HIMSELF TO ANSWER

25:53.010 --> 25:55.179
HIS SILENCE WAS ENOUGH
OF AN ANSWER

25:58.891 --> 26:01.560
That's not okay, Choi Yoon.

26:02.395 --> 26:04.021
This place is so big.

26:04.105 --> 26:05.523
Do you live here all alone?

26:07.233 --> 26:09.026
Are you paying back the 6K?

26:09.110 --> 26:11.404
Why are doing this, Tae-ha? Stop.

26:12.697 --> 26:14.031
This isn't who you are.

26:16.826 --> 26:19.829
I'm not the Kang Tae-ha
who used to do everything you said.

26:20.871 --> 26:23.291
The Kang Tae-ha
who used to follow you around…

26:24.583 --> 26:25.584
is long gone.

26:26.502 --> 26:27.837
Tae-ha.

26:27.920 --> 26:28.921
Just don't.

26:29.422 --> 26:30.673
[scoffs]

26:30.756 --> 26:31.757
A puppy?

26:32.508 --> 26:33.926
I can be one.

26:34.885 --> 26:36.095
From now on,

26:36.721 --> 26:39.265
I will only be like that for Choi Yoon.

26:40.933 --> 26:43.477
FROM NOW ON,
I'LL ONLY BE LIKE THAT FOR CHOI YOON

26:48.983 --> 26:51.819
[Eui-ju] So, I made the right choice.

26:51.902 --> 26:54.447
It's better than deleting it.
[breathes shakily]

26:54.530 --> 26:56.657
In moments of difficult choices,

26:56.741 --> 26:59.618
taking a harder path
is what ultimately saves me.

27:00.494 --> 27:03.247
Oh, no. I don't think so.
It might kill me instead.

27:03.331 --> 27:04.749
[Eui-ju whimpers]

27:10.755 --> 27:12.757
[chair scraping]

27:16.719 --> 27:18.095
Isn't the penthouse,

27:18.721 --> 27:20.139
supposed to be Ju Si-on's?

27:21.682 --> 27:22.683
What?

27:23.893 --> 27:24.894
What did I say?

27:26.520 --> 27:29.565
Si-on is the… protagonist.

27:29.648 --> 27:30.649
Again.

27:31.275 --> 27:33.110
Ju Si-on is the protagonist.

27:33.194 --> 27:35.571
That's right. From now on,
Si-on is the obsessive guy

27:35.654 --> 27:36.947
while Kang Tae-ha is regretful.

27:37.031 --> 27:39.075
Give all the heavy plots
and key lines to Si-on,

27:39.158 --> 27:41.577
and cut down Tae-ha's parts
for the rewrite.

27:46.499 --> 27:47.917
Now.

27:49.627 --> 27:50.961
What? Here?

27:52.963 --> 27:53.964
You have one hour.

27:59.929 --> 28:00.930
Move.

28:01.430 --> 28:02.598
[scoffs]

28:03.307 --> 28:04.308
Oh?

28:09.230 --> 28:11.357
If your heart is already set
on Kang Tae-ha,

28:11.440 --> 28:13.067
there's nothing I can do about it.

28:13.150 --> 28:16.028
But I'm not just gonna sit back.

28:16.112 --> 28:17.738
Now I belong to Choi Yoon.

28:21.659 --> 28:22.993
Hold on, Imuk.

28:23.077 --> 28:24.078
Something's off here.

28:27.289 --> 28:28.290
Huh?

28:29.583 --> 28:31.085
[stammers, laughs]

28:31.168 --> 28:33.212
Mmm, why? What is it? [chuckles]

28:33.295 --> 28:36.006
Isn't that something
Tae-ha's supposed to say?

28:36.090 --> 28:37.174
[scoffs]

28:38.259 --> 28:39.927
[chuckles] Mmm.

28:40.010 --> 28:43.055
I know, right?
It does feel a little awkward.

28:43.139 --> 28:45.474
You're right. [chuckles]
But let's go with it for now.

28:45.558 --> 28:48.936
This is where Yoon needs to wake up
and realize Si-on's not it.

28:49.019 --> 28:51.188
-He's fallen for this way too many times.
-[sighs]

28:51.272 --> 28:52.857
It's getting frustrating.

28:52.940 --> 28:54.358
And if it doesn't go this way,

28:54.442 --> 28:57.069
we don't even get the whole regret arc
where Si-on suffers.

28:57.153 --> 29:00.072
At this rate, he won't even get
a single moment of regret.

29:00.156 --> 29:01.907
Besides, I thought…

29:03.159 --> 29:04.285
I was the protagonist.

29:04.910 --> 29:07.371
But right now, it seems like Ju Si-on is.

29:09.457 --> 29:11.417
-Mmm.
-Oh…

29:11.500 --> 29:13.294
No. Not at all. [chuckles]

29:13.377 --> 29:16.422
That's not true at all.
Absolutely not. [chuckles]

29:17.214 --> 29:18.966
Uh, it's just…

29:19.049 --> 29:24.221
I was writing and then I realized the need
to change the flow of the story a bit.

29:24.305 --> 29:25.973
This way, how should I put it…

29:26.056 --> 29:28.976
Hmm. The characters will go through
a wide range of emotions,

29:29.059 --> 29:30.686
which will really bring the story to life.

29:30.769 --> 29:32.146
-[chuckles]
-Huh.

29:32.229 --> 29:33.230
But then that's…

29:34.231 --> 29:35.232
Just a moment. [chuckles]

29:41.947 --> 29:44.783
Do I really have to change this
for you to feel validated?

29:55.419 --> 29:57.296
Good. [sighs]

29:57.379 --> 29:59.423
You're doing incredibly well right now.

29:59.507 --> 30:02.551
It's great. So please,
hang in there a little more, everyone.

30:02.635 --> 30:03.636
Let's go.

30:04.178 --> 30:06.222
-Let's do this.
-Okay, okay. All right, let's go.

30:06.305 --> 30:07.640
-Okay, let's do this.
-Let's go.

30:07.723 --> 30:09.558
-All right, here I go.
-[Si-on grunts]

30:11.227 --> 30:12.895
-Wh-What are you doing?
-From now on,

30:13.771 --> 30:15.814
I belong only to Choi Yoon.

30:21.487 --> 30:22.947
[Eui-ju sighs]

30:23.030 --> 30:24.698
Is this even right?

30:24.782 --> 30:27.910
It's my novel
but I can't even write it the way I want.

30:31.121 --> 30:32.498
[gasps] Wait a second.

30:33.666 --> 30:36.377
He checks each episode in a Word file.

30:38.003 --> 30:39.964
Hmm. This is much better.

30:40.673 --> 30:42.508
-Really?
-Post it.

30:49.765 --> 30:51.767
[rock music playing]

30:55.354 --> 30:57.940
WE WERE FRIENDS
EPISODE 4 REAL

31:00.442 --> 31:01.277
EPISODE 4 REAL

31:01.944 --> 31:02.820
WE WERE FRIENDS

31:07.616 --> 31:08.617
SUBMIT A NEW PROJECT

31:11.620 --> 31:13.372
WE WERE FRIENDS, EPISODE 4

31:13.455 --> 31:14.873
[chuckles]

31:26.176 --> 31:27.428
[music continues]

31:30.014 --> 31:33.267
[Eui-ju] Math isn't actually going to go
on the web novel website

31:33.350 --> 31:35.894
and search for "We Were Friends"
just to check this.

31:35.978 --> 31:38.314
-[Woo-su] Look at this girl.
-[Young-hee] Today is the day.

31:38.397 --> 31:41.442
Please make sure
to keep the students' attire and behavior

31:41.525 --> 31:43.569
-under control for a successful…
-[Woo-su] What's going on?

31:43.652 --> 31:45.112
[Eui-ju] You want me to secretly film him?

31:45.195 --> 31:46.905
I'll keep from others for you.

31:46.989 --> 31:48.073
I know everything, brat.

31:48.157 --> 31:51.160
[Young-hee] If you won't cooperate,
it leaves me no choice.

31:51.243 --> 31:53.454
[Dong-ju] Why do you take it this far?
You're going to regret it.

31:53.537 --> 31:54.872
[Woo-su] Will you betray my trust or not?

31:54.955 --> 31:56.540
-[Dong-ju] I'm on it.
-[Woo-su] Go ahead then.

31:56.624 --> 31:59.084
[Eui-ju] Mr. Ga, what do I do now?

31:59.835 --> 32:02.171
[shudders] Should I just transfer schools?

32:02.254 --> 32:04.131
[music continues]

32:56.725 --> 32:57.893
[song fades]
